`${CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR}/../../../.agents/skills/skill-curator/SKILL.md` now and follow it as this skill.
Wherever it mentions this skill's folder or its scripts, use
`${CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR}/../../../.agents/skills/skill-curator/`.
